*Australia: {{cite web |url=http://www.smh.com.au/entertainment/music/tlc-review-fan-mail-for-a-fun-show-20161115-gsqa7l.html |title=TLC review: fan mail for a fun show |last=Zuel |first=Bernard |date=November 16, 2016 |access-date=January 1, 2017 |work=[[The Sydney Morning Herald]] |ref=none}}
*Philippines: {{cite news |url=http://lifestyle.inquirer.net/243638/7-super-moments-from-the-tlc-x-swv-concert/ |title=7 Super moments from the TLC x SWV concert |last=Ignacio |first=Angela V. |date=November 13, 2016 |access-date=January 1, 2017 |newspaper=[[Philippine Daily Inquirer]] |ref=none }}
